WEBVTT

00:01.520 --> 00:06.800
In reply to Father: it was Chu Huan acting on his own authority. Your son was entirely unaware beforehand!

00:07.760 --> 00:13.200
Good. Then by that reasoning, the treason lies solely upon Chu Huan's shoulders!

00:13.600 --> 00:14.800
Behead him!

00:15.560 --> 00:19.500
I implore Imperial Father to spare his life—he was also manipulated by conspirators!
